            {
                "entry_id": "d484530b-18b4-3ba0-bccd-09bdecd8f09b",
                "word": "shaw",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "72220c31-c00c-4219-8458-476625613efe",
                        "entry_id": "d484530b-18b4-3ba0-bccd-09bdecd8f09b",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "shaws"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b1a1da14-50eb-3db6-b329-2eb13bc9fb14",
                        "entry_id": "d484530b-18b4-3ba0-bccd-09bdecd8f09b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A thicket; a small wood or grove."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "dated",
                            "dialectal"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b1f1684b-f666-4b95-81ea-9e9186b4d1e7",
                                "sense_id": "b1a1da14-50eb-3db6-b329-2eb13bc9fb14",
                                "text": "All this herd sire Lamorak / and on the morne sir lamorak took his hors and rode vnto the forest / and there he mette with two knyghtes houynge vnder the wood shawe",
                                "translation": "All this heard Sir Lamorak, and on the morn Sir Lamorak took his horse and rode unto the forest, and there he met with two knights hoving under the wood-shaw",
                                "english": "All this heard Sir Lamorak, and on the morn Sir Lamorak took his horse and rode unto the forest, and there he met with two knights hoving under the wood-shaw"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f708536b-ee46-45ee-8e5b-33d5af0076c8",
                                "sense_id": "b1a1da14-50eb-3db6-b329-2eb13bc9fb14",
                                "text": "Thenne said sire kay I requyre you lete vs preue this aduenture / I shal not fayle you said sir Gaherys / and soo they rode that tyme tyl a lake / that was that tyme called the peryllous lake / And there they abode vnder the shawe of the wood",
                                "translation": "Then said Sir Kay: I require you let us prove this adventure. I shall not fail you, said Sir Gaheris. And so they rode that time to a lake that was that time called the Perilous Lake, and there they abode under the shaw of the wood",
                                "english": "Then said Sir Kay: I require you let us prove this adventure. I shall not fail you, said Sir Gaheris. And so they rode that time to a lake that was that time called the Perilous Lake, and there they abode under the shaw of the wood"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "712a1dfe-a6ea-4ce0-8f9d-7e33c9979e2f",
                                "sense_id": "b1a1da14-50eb-3db6-b329-2eb13bc9fb14",
                                "text": "The snows are fled away, leaves on the shaws, / And grasses in the mead renew their birth,"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b9c76a03-5dfd-314b-8548-b131a10ef42f",
                        "entry_id": "d484530b-18b4-3ba0-bccd-09bdecd8f09b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The leaves and tops of vegetables, especially potatoes and turnips."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Scotland"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "21dfa465-e83d-4f4e-a856-89330741317c",
                                "sense_id": "b9c76a03-5dfd-314b-8548-b131a10ef42f",
                                "text": "Up here the hills were brave with the beauty and the heat of it, but the hayfield was still all a crackling dryness and in the potato park beyond the biggings the shaws drooped red and rusty already."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "65f11924-afb1-49e4-b1bc-f0586b8ada41",
                        "source_entry_id": "d484530b-18b4-3ba0-bccd-09bdecd8f09b",
                        "source_sense_description": "small wood",
                        "target_lang_word": "bosquet",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "bosquet",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2759be8f-5f5c-3618-aa3b-994a3d78190c",
                                        "entry_id": "5d7048c9-e0d8-3a9b-a4cd-71d74c709756",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Petit bois ; touffe d’arbres."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "10d0a9e6-f760-4c85-93f4-cce543d6fd79",
                                                "sense_id": "2759be8f-5f5c-3618-aa3b-994a3d78190c",
                                                "text": "Comme il y avait d’autres bosquets de cette sorte entre les grands chênes, je demandai pourquoi l’assassin avait choisi celui-ci plutôt que les autres."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6240e240-d84c-4b80-911d-1c5e0e9015d7",
                                                "sense_id": "2759be8f-5f5c-3618-aa3b-994a3d78190c",
                                                "text": "La terre que l’aïeul paternel de Saint-Ybars, émigré du Canada en Louisiane, avait achetée en 1749, n’était alors qu’un désert dont le centre était occupé par un bosquet de chênes séculaires."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "68b8eb0b-32b4-4e2d-9f27-2438c7cae518",
                                                "sense_id": "2759be8f-5f5c-3618-aa3b-994a3d78190c",
                                                "text": "Le jardin est si dépouillé que rien ne cache plus l’insignifiance de ce qui est, ici, concédé à l’agrément : les carcasses des charmilles, les bosquets maigres grelottent sous la pluie éternelle."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "571e6ba1-fb9a-35ff-abfc-f44a0d0c06bf",
                                        "entry_id": "5d7048c9-e0d8-3a9b-a4cd-71d74c709756",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pièce de jardin plantée d’arbres."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "765c4b66-7e91-4316-9458-5de5d92ef749",
                                                "sense_id": "571e6ba1-fb9a-35ff-abfc-f44a0d0c06bf",
                                                "text": "Madame C*** se levait ordinairement vers les cinq heures du matin pour aller se promener dans un petit bosquet au bout de son jardin."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "89bbe3e0-4346-4840-bd36-b7a04477b867",
                                                "sense_id": "571e6ba1-fb9a-35ff-abfc-f44a0d0c06bf",
                                                "text": "Ces arbrisseaux font aussi un très bel effet dans les bosquets et les boulingrins à cause de l’aspect de leurs fruits."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "fbac2dca-3258-4dda-bb0b-26d833e77266",
                        "source_entry_id": "d484530b-18b4-3ba0-bccd-09bdecd8f09b",
                        "source_sense_description": "small wood",
                        "target_lang_word": "Dickicht",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Dickicht",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b939d60d-2959-3c59-8a2f-b91b17fa2b50",
                                        "entry_id": "5ff8d88a-1855-3312-a574-edebdddbee09",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "dichtes Gestrüpp, Buschwerk, Unterholz oder dichter junger Wald"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "24d74818-0325-4fa9-8e48-10026156cb6c",
                                                "sense_id": "b939d60d-2959-3c59-8a2f-b91b17fa2b50",
                                                "text": "Die Wildschweine brachen durchs Dickicht."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "364f8793-3893-4a00-b044-2d12de9a743b",
                                                "sense_id": "b939d60d-2959-3c59-8a2f-b91b17fa2b50",
                                                "text": "„Eben wollte ich einen neuen Versuch machen, mit Abed ins Gespräch zu kommen, als eine plötzliche Gewehrsalve aus dem Dickicht wie ein Donnerschlag die Stille zerriß.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2e26de61-93b5-40d5-ad07-402988ec63fd",
                                                "sense_id": "b939d60d-2959-3c59-8a2f-b91b17fa2b50",
                                                "text": "übertragen: Man verläuft sich im Dickicht der Vorschriften."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "be08fd2b-8b80-4fbf-8699-91c590476546",
                                                "sense_id": "b939d60d-2959-3c59-8a2f-b91b17fa2b50",
                                                "text": "Dieses kleine Nachschlagwerk hilft Ihnen, das Dickicht der Fachbegriffe zu lüften."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6d88816f-c4bc-41b7-9a97-5405d3ed39d1",
                                                "sense_id": "b939d60d-2959-3c59-8a2f-b91b17fa2b50",
                                                "text": "„Unter einem grünen Dickicht waren die kleinen Rechtecke kaum noch auszumachen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c6361d1b-65b8-438c-adbb-ad1d3a19424b",
                                                "sense_id": "b939d60d-2959-3c59-8a2f-b91b17fa2b50",
                                                "text": "„Sie schossen aus dem Dickicht und verschwanden sofort wieder.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7ce401a1-c9fd-40d9-be37-6757d3173804",
                                                "sense_id": "b939d60d-2959-3c59-8a2f-b91b17fa2b50",
                                                "text": "„Ende 1571 erreicht die Expedition den portugiesischen Handelsposten Sena, ein Dorf aus Strohhütten in einem Dickicht am Fluss, und richtet sich ein.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
